{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51545","headline":"宿江馆（句） · 张爲","name":"宿江馆（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟登晚驿亭，醉罢红灯落。\n（《诗学指南》四（《吟窗杂录》卷十四正字王玄《诗中旨格》，「醉罢」作「醮罢」，幷云「此比君子欲仕于明时也」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}